; Accepted deviation: padding a commodity held at cost in two lots. Beancount reports
; the pad once for each lot held at cost, zhang once for the balance it serves.
option "operating_currency" "USD"

1970-01-01 commodity USD
1970-01-01 commodity AAPL
1970-01-01 open Assets:Broker
1970-01-01 open Assets:Cash
1970-01-01 open Equity:Open

2024-01-02 * "broker" "buy"
  Assets:Broker  10 AAPL {100 USD}
  Assets:Cash  -1000 USD
2024-01-03 * "broker" "buy more"
  Assets:Broker  5 AAPL {110 USD}
  Assets:Cash  -550 USD

2024-01-04 pad Assets:Broker Equity:Open
2024-01-05 balance Assets:Broker  20 AAPL
